Kind: widen
Issue: #412
Holds open: the race between bootstrap provisioning the first server after cap_server and cap_server taking its slot -- cap_server waits 10 s (SWITCH_OPTION_WAIT, a time and not a count) before service_checkin(), printing when it starts and stops holding, so a provisioning that does not wait for the slot to be taken meets a cap_server that is not there yet; since #744 the request then waits in the slot's queue, and the fixed tree must still pass
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4

diff --git a/uros/src/servers/cap_server/cap_server.c b/uros/src/servers/cap_server/cap_server.c
